Package: mmsyFM
Title: Multispecies MSY Fleet Model for Mixed-Fishery Harvest Strategies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Henning", "Winker", email = "henning.winker@fao.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simulates mixed fisheries in which fleet segments (e.g. demersal,
    pelagic and mixed or small-scale) allocate their fishing days across
    metiers by expected profit, on top of Schaefer surplus-production stocks
    with seasonal availability and JABBA-type process error. Finds the
    multispecies maximum sustainable yield (MMSY) subject to a safeguard for
    every stock, tunes the fleet to an open-access status quo, and tunes and
    tests effort- and closure-based harvest strategies with assessment and
    implementation error, data lags, species complexes and nominal assignment
    of stocks to fleets.
